  "notes": "{泊|と}まる means to stay overnight. Different kanji from {止|と}まる (to stop).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Intransitive ({自動詞|じどうし})\n- Transitive pair: {泊|と}める (to accommodate, to let someone stay)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜に{泊|と}まる: to stay at ~\n- {一泊|いっぱく}する: to stay one night\n- {泊|と}まりがけで: staying overnight\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {泊|と}まる: to stay overnight (at accommodation)\n- {止|と}まる: to stop (movement ceases)\n- {宿泊|しゅくはく}する: to lodge (formal)",
